<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:28:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>土耳其释放因资金危机入狱 18 天的前部长</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days</link><description>土耳其前部长法特玛·贝图尔·萨扬·卡亚 (Fatma Betul Sayan Kaya) 在一次震动该国市场的投资基金调查中被捕，仅 18 天后就被释放出狱。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days'&gt;土耳其释放因资金危机入狱 18 天的前部长&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey Frees Ex-Minister Jailed in Fund Crisis After 18 Days&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:40:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Anthropic 股价第四个交易日跌破 IPO 价格</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading</link><description>Anthropic PBC 股价较 83 美元的首次公开募股价格下跌近 9%，抹去了上周涌入该人工智能实验室创纪录首次公开募股的投资者的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading'&gt;Anthropic 股价第四个交易日跌破 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Shares Plunge Below IPO Price in Fourth Trading Day&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:19:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能是一个融资故事</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/ai-is-a-financing-story</link><description>下一章将会更加艰难。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/ai-is-a-financing-story'&gt;人工智能是一个融资故事&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AI Is a Financing Story&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/ai-is-a-financing-story</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:42:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>全球抛售打击风险情绪，拉美货币引领新兴市场下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/emerging-market-stocks-rally-as-huang-s-return-revives-ai-trade</link><description>由于金属价格下跌和美国科技股再次遭到抛售，大多数拉美货币周二暴跌，引发投资者逃离风险资产。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/emerging-market-stocks-rally-as-huang-s-return-revives-ai-trade'&gt;全球抛售打击风险情绪，拉美货币引领新兴市场下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latam Currencies Lead EM Losses as Global Selloff Hits Risk Mood&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/emerging-market-stocks-rally-as-huang-s-return-revives-ai-trade</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:26:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</link><description>由于美国股市回吐了周一大幅上涨的部分涨幅，美国国债因避险需求而上涨，这表明投资者仍对技术投资继续推动经济增长的潜力感到不安。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns'&gt;随着股市下跌，国债上涨，避险需求复苏&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Advance as Stocks Fall, Reviving Haven Demand&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/treasuries-advance-as-cheaper-oil-alleviates-inflation-concerns</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:42:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能溃败推动债券上涨，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>华尔街对人工智能交易持久性的怀疑导致科技股下跌，同时促使投资者转向安全的债券。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;人工智能溃败推动债券上涨，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Sinks as AI Rout Fuels Gains in Bonds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>量化基金减少美国国债空头押注，推动债券反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids</link><description>追逐趋势的量化基金正在削减其长期持有的美国国债空头头寸，随着股票抛售重振对政府债务的避险需求，推动了债券上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids'&gt;量化基金减少美国国债空头押注，推动债券反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Quant Funds Reduce US Treasury Short Bets, Fueling Bond Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/trend-followers-dump-bond-shorts-as-stocks-swoon-aids-haven-bids</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:08:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巴西实际收益因卢拉支持更多支出限制的报​​道而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</link><description>有报道称，总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦支持遏制财政支出的举措，缓解了人们对预算赤字的担忧，自他意外连任以来，预算赤字拖累了巴西雷亚尔的贬值，巴西雷亚尔创下近两个月来的最大涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs'&gt;巴西实际收益因卢拉支持更多支出限制的报​​道而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Real Gains on Reports Lula Backs More Spending Curbs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:12:01 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>